 *   - Returns a 'not found' (404) or validation error (4xx/5xx) without altering any records
 *   - Triggers audit logging for the failed update attempt (side effect; cannot be directly asserted here)
 *   - No setting is created nor modified by this operation
 *
 * Steps:
