 * Validate that a registered member can create a subscription to a topic or thread.
 *
 * - Registers a new discussion board member (using admin endpoint, as required)
 * - Member subscribes themselves to a target (topic or thread) using member subscription endpoint
 * - Confirms that the created subscription references the correct member id, target, and notification method
 * - Ensures all response fields are as expected, and business rules (such as linking subscription to self) are enforced
 */
